; A cost that gives only its currency leaves the number to Booking.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "Per-unit cost interpolated"
  Assets:Stock    2 HOOL {USD}
  Assets:Cash  -200 USD

2020-01-03 * "Total cost interpolated"
  Assets:Stock    4 HOOL {{USD}}
  Assets:Cash  -100 USD

2020-01-04 * "Dated and labelled, with a price"
  Assets:Stock    2 HOOL {2020-01-01, USD, "lot"} @ 110 USD
  Assets:Cash  -240 USD

2020-01-05 * "Lot in another currency"
  Assets:Stock    2 HOOL {90 EUR}
  Assets:Cash  -180 EUR

2020-01-06 * "Reduction selects the lot by label and currency"
  Assets:Stock   -2 HOOL {USD, "lot"}
  Assets:Cash   240 USD

2020-01-07 balance Assets:Stock  8 HOOL
2020-01-07 balance Assets:Cash  -300 USD
2020-01-07 balance Assets:Cash  -180 EUR
